| Question | Answer |
| --- | --- |
| Monsoon's root cause? | Land–sea temperature contrast |
| Onset over Kerala? | About 1 June |
| Wettest place on Earth? | Mawsynram, Meghalaya |
| Who gets retreating-monsoon rain? | The Tamil Nadu coast |
| Share of annual rain from SW monsoon? | About 75% |
| El Niño's usual effect? | Weakens the Indian monsoon |
| Kharif crops? | Rice, jute, cotton, maize |
